      "entity_granularity": "Standards use L2-station and L3-device level, providing the most detailed facility classification and design parameters",
      "relation_explicitness": "Standards use R1-qualitative-REQUIREMENT (mandatory/推荐性), unique among all material types",
      "attribute_precision": "Standards provide A3-rated values (design/nominal parameters), the highest precision for design parameters",
      "unique_contribution_1": "Standards define MANDATORY requirements (backup power, SCADA deployment, stability criteria) that other materials do not",
      "unique_contribution_2": "Standards provide complete facility classification systems and terminology definitions",
      "unique_contribution_3": "Standards specify safety thresholds (N-1, Kp>=1.05, leak_rate<=12%) that serve as constraint parameters for models",
      "cascade_description": "GB 38755 explicitly requires cascading failure prevention but does not describe cascade mechanisms",
      "cyber_layer": "Standards require SCADA/monitoring but do not specify architecture or protocols",
      "gap": "Standards cover power OR water separately; NO standard covers water-power interdependency"
